    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "After the success of the Summer English Courses last year, ELE_net offered a programme of Winter English Courses. This consisted of the following courses: Academic Discussion Skills, Academic Presentation Skills, English for the Media and Language Accuracy in Writing. The courses ran over a four-week period from mid-November. Attendance on the courses was very good, with over 150 students registering for them."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ELE_net received very positive feedback from the students taking the courses. Building on this success, ELE_net is planning to over the Summer and Winter programmes again in 2019 and add additional courses, such as Conversational English and Academic Grammar."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To register online for the Summer 2019 courses, please go to \n      "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "https://www.aku.edu/ele-net/students/Pages/Student_English_Courses.aspx",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "http://www.aku.edu/ele-net/students/Pages/Student_English_Courses.aspx",
